  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1: FluentWindow now defaults to a solid Fluent background — the full-client Mica glass pass double-composites GDI-rendered pixels and ghosted text on Windows 11; Mica/Acrylic remain opt-in via BackdropType. 1.2.0: .NET Framework support lowered to 4.6+ — the net48 target is replaced by net46 (one assembly compatible with 4.6 through 4.8); DPI queries fall back to the OS on frameworks without Control.DeviceDpi. 1.1.7: drop-down list no longer hides the items above the selection after picking an item. 1.1.6: \"Edit Items...\" smart tag link opens the string collection editor in the .NET 6/8/10 out-of-process designer. 1.1.5: native ComboBox-style smart tag — \"Use Data Bound Items\" checkbox, unbound \"Edit Items...\" string collection editor, bound data-source drop-down and member fields. 1.1.4: real data-source drop-down + localized smart tag labels. 1.1.3: smart tag in the .NET 6/8/10 out-of-process designer. 1.1.1: ListControl-style data binding. 1.1.0: Chinese manual; categorized toolbox.",
